{"a":[50,50],"h":"<p>50.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"66\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 65.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 23.2 32.2 32.2 41.2\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.2 41.2 49.4\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> işte bu da - ya'ni Kur'an da<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"108\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 107.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.8 36.0 42.8 49.6 49.6 65.3 65.3 72.8 72.8 84.0 84.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"27.8 42.8 91.6\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> öyle mübarek bir zikirdir ki <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"82\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 81.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 23.3 30.0 36.7 36.7 44.3 51.7 51.7 58.6\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"30.0 44.3 58.6 65.3\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> onu biz indirdik - ey evvelki Peygamberlere verilen gibi âyet istiyenler <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"160\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 159.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.0 35.3 35.3 42.7 42.7 54.7 54.7 61.6 61.6 77.3 77.3 84.0 100.6 100.6 109.6 109.6 116.3 116.3 123.0 129.7 136.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 84.0 123.0 129.7 136.6 143.3\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> şimdi siz bunu mu inkâr ediyorsunuz.</p>"}